00:00:11.812 --> 00:00:14.181 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pas mal moins "hot" qu'avant.

00:00:12.712 --> 00:00:15.081 size:53% position:73% line:53%
On voit moins de monde, ils

00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:16.449 size:53% position:73% line:53%
