00:00:14.481 --> 00:00:17.284 size:53% position:73% line:53%
on se dit : ils sont où,

00:00:15.382 --> 00:00:18.185 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ces personnes-là?

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:19.052 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Une itinérance plus cachée

00:00:17.584 --> 00:00:19.953 size:53% position:73% line:53%
