00:00:18.485 --> 00:00:20.820 size:53% position:73% line:53%
du logement.

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:21.755 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Moi, j'aurais besoin juste

00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:27.060 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'un petit logement, un petit

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:27.928 size:53% position:73% line:53%
studio, là, ça ferait bien

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:28.795 size:53% position:73% line:53%
