00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:34.134 size:53% position:73% line:53%
LIONEL CARMANT, ministre délégué

00:00:32.666 --> 00:00:35.035 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Santé et Services sociaux, Qc

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:35.902 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Mon but, c'est d'amener

00:00:34.434 --> 00:00:36.770 size:53% position:73% line:53%
