00:00:36.203 --> 00:00:40.574 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de l'itinérance.

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:41.441 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- L'argent servira, entre

00:00:40.006 --> 00:00:44.778 size:53% position:73% line:53%
