00:00:51.351 --> 00:00:54.120 size:53% position:73% line:53%
servira à la prévention.

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:55.155 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- On va prévenir l'itinérance

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:56.189 size:53% position:73% line:53%
