00:00:56.489 --> 00:00:59.826 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en dépendance. On va prévenir

00:00:57.524 --> 00:01:00.860 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'itinérance après

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:04.664 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'incarcération. On va prévenir

00:01:00.126 --> 00:01:05.665 size:53% position:73% line:53%
