00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:17.043 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ANNIE SAVAGE, dir. gén. Réseau

00:01:15.275 --> 00:01:18.044 size:53% position:73% line:53%
aide aux personnes itinérantes

00:01:16.309 --> 00:01:19.079 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Il y a une reconnaissance

00:01:17.344 --> 00:01:20.113 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des parcours en itinérance,

00:01:18.345 --> 00:01:21.147 size:53% position:73% line:53%
