00:01:23.516 --> 00:01:26.286 size:53% position:73% line:53%
CÉCILE ARBAUD, directrice

00:01:24.550 --> 00:01:27.354 size:53% position:73% line:53%
générale Dans la rue

00:01:25.585 --> 00:01:28.355 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- C'est très encourageant.

00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:29.389 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Il ne faut juste pas que

00:01:27.654 --> 00:01:30.423 size:53% position:73% line:53%
