00:01:33.693 --> 00:01:36.596 size:53% position:73% line:53%
MATHIEU FRAPPIER, Réseau org. et

00:01:34.861 --> 00:01:37.630 size:53% position:73% line:53%
interv. en itinérance de Laval

00:01:35.862 --> 00:01:38.665 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Dans notre contexte, à Laval,

00:01:36.896 --> 00:01:39.666 size:53% position:73% line:53%
